Cell["\<\
But it is useful to add discrete torsion phases for real orbits, so that the \
unknown phases A are  \[PlusMinus]1 . These were chosen by hand while the \
authors worked on this issue by trial and error. \
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"34890966-4b62-4fae-a94e-347cfec913c7"],

